      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1916 and 1940, earthquakes devastated Imperial, prompting statewide building code reforms that strengthened the 1933 Field Act for schools.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
